#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-code-overview.rst:7
#: 78de5a8fe41843e4ba7e54325fd78ff7
msgid ""
"The `code <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__ is made up of `the "
"main Copter code "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/ArduCopter>`__ which "
"resides in its own directory, and `the libraries "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries>`__ which are "
"shared with Plane and Rover."
msgstr ""
"`代码 <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__ 由位于独立目录的 `Copter 主代码 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/ArduCopter>`__，以及与 Plane"
" 和 Rover 共享的 `库 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries>`__ 组成。"

